{"4396030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OKEYABILITY", "steam_appid": 4396030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚀 The Next Dimension of Okey: Join the Fun at the Table of the Future!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the same old, ordinary Okey games? <strong>Okey Ability</strong> invites you to a table where neon lights meet deep strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to enjoy <strong>Classic Okey</strong> rules with your friends or shake things up by using <strong>unique abilities</strong> to disrupt the game—every round here is a brand-new thrill!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Easy to Learn, Thrilling to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you know the basics of Okey, you’re already halfway there!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Interface:</strong> Forget the clutter! Our system lets you sort your tiles with a single touch, allowing you to focus purely on the fun and your next move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for Everyone:</strong> Whether you are a seasoned pro or a first-time player, Okey Ability is designed to provide an enjoyable experience for all skill levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/0364daefa929946afb062af51fec1095.poster.avif?t=1784051341\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/0364daefa929946afb062af51fec1095.webm?t=1784051341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/0364daefa929946afb062af51fec1095.mp4?t=1784051341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏆 The Path to Victory: Arrange Your Sets and Finish First!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Okey Ability</strong>, all you need is the right strategy and a bit of timing. Whether through traditional tactics or with the help of your abilities, aim to be the fastest to clear your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Runs and Sets:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runs:</strong> Line up consecutive numbers of the same color (e.g., Blue 5, 6, 7).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sets:</strong> Group the same numbers with different colors (e.g., Blue 7, Red 7, Yellow 7).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/48453bfbaf9eff3c8e3a195f2be12c3b.poster.avif?t=1784051341\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/48453bfbaf9eff3c8e3a195f2be12c3b.webm?t=1784051341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/48453bfbaf9eff3c8e3a195f2be12c3b.mp4?t=1784051341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go for Pairs (Double):</strong> If you're feeling lucky, collect identical pairs to deliver a heavy blow to your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/73a435c0256ed1e99bd8307554e1cc26.poster.avif?t=1784051341\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/73a435c0256ed1e99bd8307554e1cc26.webm?t=1784051341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/73a435c0256ed1e99bd8307554e1cc26.mp4?t=1784051341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📊 End-Game Analysis: See the Unseen!</strong> Once the round ends, everything is revealed on the table!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Check the Remaining Points:</strong> See exactly how many points (or tiles) your opponents had left and which specific tile they were waiting for to win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Meta:</strong> Analyze your rivals' strategies, decode their playstyles, and come back to the table even stronger for the next round!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/87c71ae345036c19a969571fcc0fcca5.poster.avif?t=1784051341\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/87c71ae345036c19a969571fcc0fcca5.webm?t=1784051341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/87c71ae345036c19a969571fcc0fcca5.mp4?t=1784051341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚀 The Next Dimension of Okey: Join the Fun at the Table of the Future!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the same old, ordinary Okey games? <strong>Okey Ability</strong> invites you to a table where neon lights meet deep strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to enjoy <strong>Classic Okey</strong> rules with your friends or shake things up by using <strong>unique abilities</strong> to disrupt the game—every round here is a brand-new thrill!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Easy to Learn, Thrilling to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you know the basics of Okey, you’re already halfway there!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Interface:</strong> Forget the clutter! Our system lets you sort your tiles with a single touch, allowing you to focus purely on the fun and your next move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for Everyone:</strong> Whether you are a seasoned pro or a first-time player, Okey Ability is designed to provide an enjoyable experience for all skill levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/0364daefa929946afb062af51fec1095.poster.avif?t=1784051341\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/0364daefa929946afb062af51fec1095.webm?t=1784051341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396030/extras/0364daefa929946afb062af51fec1095.mp4?t=1784051341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏆 The Path to Victory: Arrange Your Sets and Finish First!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Okey Ability</strong>, all you need is the right strategy and a bit of timing. Whether through traditional tactics or with the help of your abilities, aim to be the fastest to clear your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Runs and Sets:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runs:</strong> Line up consecutive numbers of the same color (e.g., Blue 5, 6, 7).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sets:</strong> Group the same numbers with different colors (e.g., Blue 7, Red 7, Yellow 7).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop